  "text": "Garden House Flow QA\nRESTAURANT ADMIN\nGarden House Flow QA — Main Branch\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nBranch\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nGarden House Flow QA — Main Branch · MAIN\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nDAILY\nToday\nOrders\nMenu\nCustomers & loyalty\nDevices & sync\nOPERATIONS\nKIOSK MANAGEMENT\nKiosk Terminals\nCustomer experience\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nKiosk payment settings\nKiosk feedback\nQR ORDERING\nREPORTS\nSETUP\nCustomer experience\n\nDesign, review and test the guest journey for Garden House Flow QA — Main Branch. Welcome screens can also be customized for individual kiosks.\n\nWelcome & language\nMenu & checkout\nPayments\nReceipt\nWhat customers can order\nPrivate journey preview\n\nKIOSK · APPEARANCE\n\nWelcome Screen\n\nCustomize the experience guests see before they start ordering.\n\nReset to Default\nApply to Kiosk\nBranch default · Garden House Flow QA — Main Branch\n\nApplies to 0 kiosk(s) in this branch. Kiosks with their own saved override keep their design.\n\nShowing the saved configuration.\n\nApply to\nAll kiosks in this branch\n\nGarden House Flow QA — Main Branch\n\nBranch settings stay within this branch. Individual kiosks can use their own design. Switch branch before configuring another location.\n\nHotel name & welcome message\n\n1. Enter the hotel or restaurant name. 2. Add a greeting and personal message. These appear immediately in the preview. Leave a field empty to use the restaurant or language default.\n\nHotel / restaurant name\nWelcome greeting\nCustom welcome message\nStart Order button\nTouch instruction\nRestaurant logo URL\n\nUpload your restaurant logo in Appearance & Content. Names and messages are live UI, never printed into a background.\n\nShow freshly prepared note\nShow promotion\nSecond screen: Choose your language\n\nChoose the background shown immediately after Start Order. This follows the same branch or terminal scope selected above.\n\nLanguage screen background\nKeep the original language-screen design\nUse the same background as the welcome screen\nChoose a separate background\nPreview language screen\nBackground collection\n\n16 available platform designs ? Selection limit: 100. Live text always stays editable.\n\nUpload Custom Background\n\nRecommended: 1080 × 1920 portrait. PNG, JPG or WebP, up to 12 MB. Uploads are optimized before saving. Three custom designs per branch.\n\nRefresh available designs\nDefault\nActive\nSelected\nRoyal Indian Dining\n\nIvory palace & brass\n\nPreview\nDefault\nModern Indian Dining\n\nSage contemporary bistro\n\nPreview\nDefault\nGujarati Thali\n\nGujarati thali & warm gold\n\nPreview\nDefault\nNorth Indian Cuisine\n\nNorth Indian copper & spice\n\nPreview\nDefault\nSouth Indian Cuisine\n\nSouth Indian banana leaf\n\nPreview\nDefault\nIndian Street Food\n\nStreet food & cheerful color\n\nPreview\nDefault\nPremium Biryani\n\nBiryani & amber clay\n\nPreview\nDefault\nVegetarian Garden\n\nVegetarian botanical green\n\nPreview\nDefault\nCafé & Casual Dining\n\nCafe oak & cream\n\nPreview\nDefault\nHeritage Sweets\n\nSweets & heritage gold\n\nPreview\nDefault\nMidnight Spice\n\nDark & Dramatic\n\nPreview\nDefault\nTerracotta Table\n\nRustic & Earthy\n\nPreview\nDefault\nTeal Pop Kitchen\n\nModern & Playful\n\nPreview\nDefault\nBotanical Bistro\n\nBotanical & Fresh\n\nPreview\nDefault\nPastel Patisserie\n\nCafé & Pastel\n\nPreview\nDefault\nUrban Street Kitchen\n\nBold & Urban\n\nPreview\nKiosk Preview\nSaved configuration\nWelcome screen preview\nLanguage screen preview\nPortrait\nLandscape\n768 × 1024\n800 × 1280\n820 × 1180\n1024 × 768\n1280 × 800\n1366 × 768\n1920 × 1080\nFreshly prepared · Served with care\n\nWelcome to\n\nGarden House Flow QA\n\nAuthentic Flavors, Seamless Dining\n\nStart Order\n\nTouch screen to begin your order\n\nSame renderer as the customer kiosk · English preview · 800 × 1280\n\nImage fit & position\nFit\nFill screen · Cover\nShow full photo · Soft backdrop\nHorizontal position · 50\nVertical position · 50\nZoom · 1\nReadability overlay · 0.2\nConfiguration delivery\n\nVersion: 1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\n\nBundled default - no custom configuration published\n\nOnline kiosks receive configuration events. Offline kiosks keep their last saved design and catch up after reconnecting.\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE\nDisplay",
